# Force LF on every platform. Load-bearing, not cosmetic:
#  - migration files are checksummed (BUILD-SPEC.md §17.1): CRLF vs LF would change the checksum
#    and make the ledger reject an unedited file
#  - the .claude/hooks/*.sh scripts break under bash with CRLF line endings
#  - the spec files are verified by md5sum
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.sql text eol=lf
